    <briefdescription>
<para>Top-level entry point that runs a <ref refid="namespace_b_i_basis" kindref="compound">BIBasis</ref> (boolean involutive) computation on an engine <computeroutput><ref refid="class_matrix" kindref="compound">Matrix</ref></computeroutput> and returns the result as a <computeroutput><ref refid="class_matrix" kindref="compound">Matrix</ref></computeroutput>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><computeroutput>GetBIBasisMatrix(matrix, toGroebner)</computeroutput> validates the input via <computeroutput><ref refid="class_b_i_basis_1_1_launcher_a3f33ad4f0779f3e83ef4c02c62b0dbd0_1a3f33ad4f0779f3e83ef4c02c62b0dbd0" kindref="member">CheckMatrix</ref></computeroutput>, dispatches to the involutive solver configured through <computeroutput><ref refid="class_b_i_basis_1_1_settings_manager" kindref="compound">SettingsManager</ref></computeroutput>, and converts the resulting set of monomials back into a <computeroutput><ref refid="class_matrix" kindref="compound">Matrix</ref></computeroutput>. The <computeroutput>toGroebner</computeroutput> flag selects between the involutive basis (0) and its derived Groebner basis (1). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
